Package: xkb-fi-pl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, xkb-data (>= 2.42), xkb-data (<< 3~)
Recommends: console-setup
Description: Finnish keyboard layout with Polish characters on AltGr
 An XKB layout named "fipl": the standard Finnish layout, fi(classic), with
 the nine Polish letters added on the third level, reached with AltGr, in the
 same positions as on the Polish (pl) layout:
 .
 a-ogonek, c-acute, e-ogonek, l-stroke, n-acute, o-acute, s-acute,
 z-acute and z-dot-above, with their capitals on AltGr+Shift.
 .
 Nothing else is changed: the Finnish base keeps a-ring, o-diaeresis,
 a-diaeresis and its dead keys. AltGr+l replaces the Finnish dead_stroke,
 and the keypad decimal key is kept as a dot rather than the Finnish comma.
 .
 Installing this package only makes the layout available. It does not
 select it: no user setting and no file under /etc/default is touched.
 Choose it in your desktop keyboard settings, or with localectl.
# Opisu po polsku NIE da sie tu umiescic: dpkg odrzuca pole Description-pl
# w sekcji pakietu binarnego ("unknown information field") i nie przenosi go
# do gotowego .deb. Debian tlumaczy opisy osobnym kanalem (DDTP, pliki
# Translation-* w archiwum), a nie przez debian/control. Polski opis jest
# w README.md, ktory pakiet instaluje do /usr/share/doc/xkb-fi-pl/.
